<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <title>Prove Your WebMarketplace Identity</title>
  <style>
    .container {
      margin: 0 auto;
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 600px;
      padding: 20px;
      line-height: 1.6;
      font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace;
      color: #333;
      background-color: #f9f9f9;
    }

    .otp {
      text-align: center;
      font-size: xx-large;
      font-weight: bolder;
      letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    }

    .header {
      font-size: 24px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #2c3e50;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      padding-bottom: 15px;
      border-bottom: 2px solid #eee;
    }

    .footer {
      margin-top: 30px;
      padding-top: 20px;
      border-top: 1px solid #eee;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #7f8c8d;
      text-align: center;
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="header">
      Prove Your WebMarketplace Identity
    </div>

    <p>
      We have received a login request for your WebMarketplace account. For
      security purposes, please verify your identity by providing the
      following code.
      <br />
      <br />
      <b>Your verification code is:</b>

      <h2 class="otp">{{ code }}</h2>

      <strong>This code is valid for 3 minutes.</strong>
    </p>



    <p style="font-size: 0.9em">
      If it wasn`t you, please ignore this message.<br />
      <strong>Do not forward or give this code to anyone.</strong>
    </p>

    <div class="footer">
      &copy; {{ currentYear }} WebMarketplace. All rights reserved.<br />
      This is an automated message, please do not reply to this email.
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
